  m_text: "A mesh is a hollow surface, and each face is drawn only from its front.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Move the Scene view camera inside this box. Do you see its walls?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Fly into the box in the Scene view. Then select the box and use Flip Normals. Look again from inside, and from outside.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, A \xB7 Hollow</color></size>"
