  m_text: "In ProBuilder, as in Unity, 1 unit is 1 metre. The floor grid is 1 m; the figure is 1.8 m tall.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> A doorway should let this person through comfortably. How tall would you make it?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select the cube and turn it into a wall 4 m long, 3 m high and 20 cm thick, by editing the shape or moving its faces. Check it against the grid.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, B \xB7 Wall</color></size>"
