  m_text: "A face can carry its own material. The mesh then gets one material slot for each material it uses.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You give the two walls one material and the floor another. How many material slots will the mesh have?\n\n<b>Try:</b> In Face mode, select the floor and drag Ceramic tiles (Assets/Library/Materials/Kit) onto it. Select both walls and drag Concrete panels onto them. Check the Mesh Renderer.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, D \xB7 Lamp post</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
