  m_text: "Some faces of a model can be copied into a separate object. Give only that object an emissive material, and only those faces glow.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You copy the front faces of the frame and make the copy emissive. What lights up? Does the frame light the floor around it?\n\n<b>Try:</b> In Face mode, select the front faces and use Duplicate Faces, with its option set to GameObject (a new object). Give the new object Neon-Cyan (Assets/Library/Materials/Kit).\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, E \xB7 Light shapes</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
