  m_text: "An opening is made by removing faces. The faces are already split into a grid (as in station 9), so the middle column can be selected on its own.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You delete the middle faces on the front and on the back. Look into the gap from an angle: what will you see inside?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select the three middle faces of the middle column, front and back (Face mode), and delete them. Then close each side of the gap with Bridge Edges.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, B \xB7 Slit wall</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
