  m_text: "Smoothing groups decide which edges look soft. Faces in the same group are shaded as one curved surface; edges between groups stay sharp.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This pillar has no smoothing. When you smooth its sides, which edges should still look sharp?\n\n<b>Try:</b> Select the side faces (Face mode). Open the Smoothing window and give them one group. Leave the top and bottom faces out.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal kit, D \xB7 Round pillar</color></size>"
